}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 A Prayer for a Person near Death}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24
{\plain \fs24 \f1 Almighty God, look on this your servant, lying in great\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 weakness, and comfort him with the promise of life\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 everlasting, given in the resurrection of your Son Jesus\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 Christ our Lord.  }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Amen.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
