}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 When possible, it is desirable that members of the family and friends\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 come together to join in the Litany.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 God the Father,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Have mercy on your servant}{\plain \fs24 \f1 .\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24
