{\plain \fs20 \f1\fs20 It is appropriate that the family and friends come together for prayers\par
}{\plain \fs20 \f1\fs20 prior to the funeral. Suitable Psalms, Lessons, and Collects (such as\par
}{\plain \fs20 \f1\fs20 those in the Burial service) may be used. The Litany at the Time of\par
}{\plain \fs20 \f1\fs20 Death may be said, or the following}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 Dear Friends: It was our Lord Jesus himself who said,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 {\u8220\'93}Come to me, all you who labor and are burdened, and I will\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 give you rest.{\u8221\'94} Let us pray, then, for our brother (sister) }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 N}{\plain \fs24 \f1 .,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 that }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 he}{\plain \fs24 \f1  may rest from }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 his}{\plain \fs24 \f1  labors, and enter into the light\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 of God's eternal sabbath rest.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3402\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3402\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f1 Receive, O Lord, your servant, for }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 he}{\plain \fs24 \f1  returns to you.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Into your hands, O Lord,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 we commend our brother (sister) N.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3402\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3402\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f1 Wash }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 him}{\plain \fs24 \f1  in the holy font of everlasting life, and clothe\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 him}{\plain \fs24 \f1  in his heavenly wedding garment.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Into your hands, O Lord,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 we commend our brother (sister) N.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3402\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
