{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-720\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3402\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f1 Almighty God, our Father in heaven, before whom live all\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 who die in the Lord: Receive our }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 brother N.}{\plain \fs24 \f1  into the courts of\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 your heavenly dwelling place.  Let }{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 his}{\plain \fs24 \f1  heart and soul now ring\par
